## LinAudit auditd rules (loaded via augenrules)

## Every command execution, system-wide (key: cmd_exec)
-a always,exit -F arch=b64 -S execve -S execveat -k cmd_exec
-a always,exit -F arch=b32 -S execve -S execveat -k cmd_exec

## Software keystroke-injection signature: any open/read/write of /dev/uinput.
## On a stock GNOME desktop almost nothing touches uinput, so hits here are notable.
-w /dev/uinput -p rwa -k uinput_inject
